error[B0503]: `Toggle` takes 1 argument(s), not 2
 --> check/signatures.bloom:9:19
  |
9 |       Toggle($on, "Notify")
  |                   ^^^^^^^^ wrong number of arguments
  |
help: write `Toggle(binding)`: a parameter marked ? is optional
  = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-language-nodes.mdx#toggle

error[B0201]: `String` is not a binding
  --> check/signatures.bloom:10:17
   |
10 |       TextField(name, "Name")
   |                 ^^^^ this node reads and writes the value
   |
help: pass a binding: `$name`, or `Binding(get: …, set: …)`
   = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#72-builders-modifiers-and-tokens

error[B0201]: expected `String`, found `Int`
